    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Todd bring this spacious large four bedroom bungalow for sale in Ballinphuil, Corofin. The property is just moments from Corofin Village and within close proximity of a number of excellent local national schools. Within a lovely community setting you have the benefit being in an exceptional location where you not only have Corofin Village on your doorstep, you also have the towns of Tuam, Claregalway and Athenry located 10/15/20 minutes away respectively, Galway City just 25 minutes away, and you also have access onto the new M17/ Gort to Tuam Motorway just 7 minutes away.\nThis property comes to the market with four double bedrooms, garage and landscaped gardens. A tarmac drive leads up to the front door, here you are greeted with a hallway with its solid timber floor done in the most beautiful mosaic square pattern design. To the left of the hall you enter into the large living room with carpet floor and oil fired stove. Just off the living room you enter into the kitchen with tiled floor and white shaker style kitchen units, sink under the picture window looking out into the landscaped rear garden. There is a back hallway off the kitchen leading to the utility, convenient toilet and large garage which could be converted into accommodation. As you walk further down the main front hallway you will find the family bathroom with bath, shower and fully tiled. Four fine sized double bedrooms all with ample space and garden views completes the property. The garden area in this case reflects the commitment to perfection so obvious inside the house. The large garage is blocked and has both window and roller door access. A garden shed offers further storage.\nThis house stands on just over a half acre site, all of which has been carefully planned. The hard landscaping, the patio, paths, and kerbing are perfect. Shrubs, trees and a small orchard soften the space while you stand to take in the beauty. This property isn't just a home—it's a lifestyle opportunity. Whether you're looking for a peaceful retreat, a place to indulge your hobbies, or a family-friendly home with room to grow, this property offers it all.\nDon't miss out on this rare gem—contact us today to arrange a private viewing and experience everything this home has to offer!\nIf you're interested in more details or have specific questions about the property, feel free to get in contact Sherry FitzGerald Todd on 09326622 or email info@sftodd.ie"
      },
